// Who else uses these addresses, and since when. A first-seen date shared by
// many users on the same day is a network change (new circuit, new VPN), not a
// relocation. Placeholders: {IPS} = quoted, comma-separated list.
AzureSigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| where IPAddress in ({IPS})
| summarize events = count(), firstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), lastSeen = max(TimeGenerated)
    by IPAddress, UserPrincipalName
| order by IPAddress asc, events desc
